      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرْفَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A question,</i> or <i>questioning, respecting a
subject of information, in order to know it;</i> (K, *
TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرْفَةٌ</span></b> . (K, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرْفٌ</span>. ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  Also <i>A purulent pustule that comes forth in
the whiteness</i> [or <i>palm</i>] <i>of the hand.</i> (ISk, S,
O, K.)

